    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42063" root="وطأ" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا يُتَوَضَّأُ مِنْ مَوْطَإٍ</span></b>  <i>One is not to perform</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وضوء</span>
(i. e., to repeat it,) <i>on account of treading on
filth in the road:</i> but this does not mean that
one is not to wash off the filth. (TA, from a
trad.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطْأَةٌ</span>.

